      "uid": "zhcn:aa425351b80e1d58f1b34974",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目在模拟赛上连续两次起跑不佳导致了出迟。\n话虽如此――",
      "source_fingerprint": "caa47830c15745eefa16f3a2d29b412209fecdd37fdde778651fb3cfa809c7f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
