    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335d0d3b27de7ed4738bece7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目对胜利的渴望非同一般。\n与其指望她靠意志解决问题，\n不如考虑进行一些提高起跑专注的训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca8271e449ae22ebbd7ef3fa61afe37e2ef68c461cf9dfe345eb5cdc41d1b3ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129114.json",
      "json_path": [
