      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "首先为了缩短起跑反应的时间，\n我决定随机性地吹哨子，\n让她听到后立刻起跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fb795dbfd3d1e83de408837ab92e480898d00a1123ae5d717e67e5c4c40cb49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
